        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“All content features fictional adult characters.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil Veil</strong> is a fantasy RPG that blends visual-novel-style storytelling with strategic card battles. Step into the role of a cold-headed exorcist and uncover the hidden stories of the charming demons you face—then break their will and subdue them. Acquire new skill cards and collect equipment after each battle as you grow into an increasingly powerful exorcist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Strategic Card Battles</strong><br>Read your enemies carefully and respond to their tactics with your own. Exploit each demon’s weaknesses and overwhelm them with powerful card combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094270/extras/101319b12a7fd2fb485583def9b8f415.poster.avif?t=1764262947\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094270/extras/101319b12a7fd2fb485583def9b8f415.webm?t=1764262947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094270/extras/101319b12a7fd2fb485583def9b8f415.mp4?t=1764262947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Build Your Own Deck</strong><br>Gather and combine a wide variety of active and passive skill cards. Create your ultimate deck to defeat even the strongest demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Progress Through Gear and Training</strong><br>Purchase equipment with unique and powerful effects to perman